{'symbol': 'GM', 'date': '2023-04-05 16:15:00', 'title': 'UNIVERSAL LOGISTICS HOLDINGS, INC. NAMED A 2022 SUPPLIER OF THE YEAR BY GENERAL MOTORS', 'text': 'WARREN, MICH. , APRIL 5, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- UNIVERSAL LOGISTICS HOLDINGS, INC. (NASDAQ:ULH) WAS NAMED A 2022 SUPPLIER OF THE YEAR BY GENERAL MOTORS ("GM").'}{'symbol': 'GM', 'date': '2023-04-05 11:45:00', 'title': 'GM DEFENSE RECEIVES FULL-RATE PRODUCTION DECISION FROM U.S. ARMY FOR INFANTRY SQUAD VEHICLE PROGRAM', 'text': 'WASHINGTON , APRIL 5, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- GM DEFENSE LLC, A SUBSIDIARY OF GENERAL MOTORS, SAID TODAY THAT THE U.S. ARMY PROVIDED A FULL-RATE PRODUCTION DECISION FOR THE INFANTRY SQUAD VEHICLE (ISV). GM DEFENSE WON THE INITIAL $214.3 MILLION CONTRACT TO DEVELOP THE LIGHT AND AGILE ALL-TERRAIN TROOP CARRIER TO TRANSPORT A NINE-SOLDIER INFANTRY SQUAD AND THEIR EQUIPMENT IN JUNE 2020.'}